    "Swift": {},
    "Xcode": {},
    "Xcode License": {},
    "Xcode Switcher": {},
    "Xcode Switcher CLI\n\n用法：\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] list\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] current\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] resolve <project.xcodeproj|workspace.xcworkspace>\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] env [目录或项目路径]\n  xcodeswitcher shell-init zsh\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] doctor [版本、别名或路径]\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] use [--dry-run] <版本、别名或路径>\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] open [--dry-run] <project.xcodeproj|workspace.xcworkspace>\n\n--json 输出机器可读 JSON；--dry-run 仅显示将执行的切换/打开动作。\nenv 和 shell-init zsh 只读取项目环境，不会修改 xcode-select。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Xcode Switcher CLI\n\nUsage:\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] list\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] current\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] resolve <project.xcodeproj|workspace.xcworkspace>\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] env [directory or project path]\n  xcodeswitcher shell-init zsh\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] doctor [version, alias or path]\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] use [--dry-run] <version, alias or path>\n  xcodeswitcher [--json] open [--dry-run] <project.xcodeproj|workspace.xcworkspace>\n\n--json prints machine-readable JSON; --dry-run only shows the switch or open that would run.\nenv and shell-init zsh only read the project environment and never change xcode-select."
          }
        }
      }
    },
