    "只影响新打开的那个终端会话，不改 xcode-select。想让它在进入项目目录时自动生效，可在「设置 → Shell 集成」启用 zsh Hook。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affects only the terminal session you open, and never changes xcode-select. To make it apply automatically when you enter a project directory, enable the zsh hook in Settings → Shell integration."
          }
        }
      }
    },
