    "在 zsh 中加入下面这行后，进入绑定了 Xcode 的项目目录会自动设置 DEVELOPER_DIR。它只影响当前 Shell，不会执行 xcode-select --switch，因此不需要授权，也不改变全机设置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add the line below to zsh and entering a project directory bound to an Xcode sets DEVELOPER_DIR automatically. It affects only the current shell and never runs xcode-select --switch, so it needs no authorization and does not change machine-wide settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
